    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2EcSfnCB2te2hWS5WUFE4A1)_\n\n## Merge order\n- Independent of the other open PRs; only `CHANGELOG.org` (Emacs and root) changes.\n\n## What\n- **Baseline**: no stored hash exists, so I used the last tidy commit `21fde6d` (#482, \"state of 2026-11-14\") as the point to continue from.\n- **Emacs changelog**\n  - Merged PRs moved out of \"Being developed\" into their sets: #418-#421, #497, #500, #511 (DEVONthink), #480/#483/#486 (citar preload), #475/#490/#496/#503/#505/#509 (BibTeX), #474, #479, #485-#487/#492/#494/#498/#502/#504/#506/#508 (batch reports and dashboard), #476, #488, #467, #493.\n  - The open chain #418-#421 is gone from \"Being developed\"; #451 now has `main` as its base. New open items: #513, #491.\n  - #484 and #489 added to the keymap entry.\n  - #438 now says ADR 0033 (0032 is the reading database of #419); #419 says ADRs 0028-0032.\n  - Links to `docs/tangles/academic/sp-devonthink*.org` and the old design doc now point to `docs/tangles/devonthink/`; `sp-devonthink-search` is described as folded into `sp-devonthink-browse` (#500).\n  - Relative links to `adr/` and `devonthink-reading.org` fixed.\n- **Root changelog**: new set \"DEVONthink highlight keys (Hammerspoon)\" (#499, #501, #507, #510, #512, #514 and the stray commit b09d4e0); #495 in the window-manager set; stray commits a5a9189 (fisher `bass`) and ab02e6e/0912eac (PR backup).\n- Merge commits left out. No repeated Changed/Added/Fixed headings.\n\n## Not done\n- No new \"Changes by pull request\" sections in the module docs this time; entries are one line each.\n- #482 (the previous tidy) is not listed. One link to `sp-collection-query-tables.org` was already broken before this PR and is left alone.\n\n- [ ] Check the DEVONthink and Hammerspoon lines read right\n- [ ] Check #452 (\"broken\") should stay under open PRs\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBsi888cwceAR8xgpT)_",
